hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"284","Bundar told us, Muadh bin Hisham told us, my father told me, on the authority of Qatada, on the authority of Abu Harb bin Abi Al-Aswad, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Ali bin Abu Talib, that the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said regarding the urine of a breastfeeding woman: “The urine of a boy should be sprinkled, and the urine of a girl should be washed.” Abu Musa told us something similar, and added: Qatada said: “This is so long as they do not feed them with food, then when they eat, they should all be washed.”"
